  "description": {
   "en": "Ayumi is a horribly bullied child. When she cries and says she wants to die, the insect dealer approaches her and says, \"I'll kill you.\" Kuniko picks a fight with Ayumi again, and in her distress, she eats the insect the insect dealer gave her and dies...!\nHowever, the next day, Ayumi comes to school in high spirits... \n\nThe heartbreaking and terrifying volume 5 of the insect horror series brought to you by the master of splatter horror!"
